{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/659678-has-anyone-done-a-2e-update-of-the-purified","id":659678,"title":"Has anyone done a 2E update of the Purified?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-09-10T12:07:49-07:00","id":659678,"title":"Has anyone done a 2E update of the Purified?","content":"I'm looking for a 2E update of the Purified from <b>World of Darkness: Immortals</b>. Bonus points if it expands them into a full template, rather than an admittedly powerful &quot;minor&quot; template. I could do the work myself, and will if need be, but it's always easier to see if someone else has done so, first.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Freelancer </b>\u2022 Available for work!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/109-claire-redfield","name":"Claire Redfield","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar109_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-10T12:51:04-07:00","id":659738,"title":"","content":"Octavo wrote a very functional GMC update for the Purified, and I know someone's made them a full splat before and had worked on updating them to 2e. Both were in the same thread around this section somewhere, if I recall correctly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/188-yeoflittlefaith","name":"YeOfLittleFaith","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar188_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"